# C15 flip ride from state 4 (rolling at 15 ft/s toward the first lip): gas; R1 and the stick forward on
# the climb, back on the lip (M21's flip.pad timing), R1 held through the air: the flip over-rotates and
# wrecks (put back), then steer both ways, brake, gas, coast.
down cross
sleep 45t
down r1
stick l 0 -1
sleep 20t
stick l 0 1
sleep 6t
stick l 0 0
sleep 120t
up r1
sleep 30t
stick l -1 0
sleep 30t
stick l 0 0
sleep 20t
stick l 1 0
sleep 30t
stick l 0 0
sleep 30t
up cross
down square
sleep 45t
up square
down cross
sleep 60t
release
sleep 30t
